Overview
--------
This repository combines original work with code derived from the following upstream projects:

1. `GaussianImage/` — distributed under the MIT License as provided in `GaussianImage/LICENSE` by the original GaussianImage authors. Our work builds upon their implementation and introduces multi-image batch rendering and related tooling.
2. `GaussianImage/gsplat/` — derived from the `gsplat` library (https://github.com/nerfstudio-project/gsplat) and distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The full license text is preserved in `GaussianImage/gsplat/LICENSE`. All modifications inside this directory, including changes made to enable multi-image batch rendering, remain subject to the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Unless another license file is present in a directory, all other source code, assets, and documentation in this repository are original contributions released under the MIT License reproduced below.

When redistributing this project, please retain:
- This top-level `LICENSE` file;
- `GaussianImage/LICENSE` (MIT License for upstream GaussianImage components);
- `GaussianImage/gsplat/LICENSE` (Apache License 2.0 for gsplat components).

